<Base title="Getting on the Same Page"><section class="interior"><div class="eyebrow">WORK / FRAMEWORKS</div><h1>Getting on the Same Page</h1><p class="lede">What do we think we agree on?</p><div class="callout"><p>A brand realignment workshop built to surface the assumptions people carry into the room.</p></div><div class="callout"><p>Individuals first share their own perceptions (including unexpected, metaphorical prompts). The group then compares the current reality with future aspirations, makes differences visible, and identifies common ground.</p></div><div class="callout"><p>The intended output is shared language, a clear direction, and a small number of practical next moves. It is a working exercise, not a presentation.</p></div><p><a href="/work/">← Back to Work</a></p></section></Base>